9f8|a|Radiating or reflecting light; shedding or having much light; shining; luminous; not dark. ; Transmitting light; clear; transparent. ; Having qualities that render conspicuous or attractive, or that affect the mind as light does the eye; resplendent with charms; as, bright beauty. ; Having a clear, quick intellect; intelligent. ; Sparkling with wit; lively; vivacious; shedding cheerfulness and joy around; cheerful; cheery. ; Illustrious; glorious. ; Manifest to the mind, as light is to the eyes; clear; evident; plain. ; Of brilliant color; of lively hue or appearance.	j:1q7u,69,3;174w,62,3;20bd,41,6;1wa7,41,2;20bb,39,4~20bd,41,6;20bb,39,4;174w,62,3;1q7u,69,3;1wa7,41,2	e:11pm,86,3;297h,32,5~297h,32,5;11pm,86,3
